152++ 6E99              ; Spectrum/ATM keyboard matrix cursor mapping:
153++ 6E99              ; CAPS SHIFT+7 = up, CAPS SHIFT+6 = down.
154++ 6E99              ; CAPS SHIFT+5 and CAPS SHIFT+8 are also sampled for left/right, although
