 48++ 72EB                      ; Cold-restart the GS105a ROM only to enter its known bootstrap
 49++ 72EB                      ; receive state. Do NOT query #20: its RAM-size report is not an
 50++ 72EB                      ; authority for Project126 physical memory and must not gate startup.
 51++ 72EB 3E 41                ld      a,'A'
